### Values

`portrait`
Rotates the page so that the height is greater than the width.
`landscape`
Rotates the page so that the width is greater than the height.

## Formal definition

|  |  |
|---------------------------|-----------------------------|
| Initial value | `portrait` |
| Applies to | all elements |
| Inherited | no |
| Media |  |
| Computed value | as specified |

## Examples

### Portrait

```css
@page {
  size: portrait;
}
```

### Landscape

